.DS_Store

# Raw per-candidate execution traces (trades.json, execution_events.json, etc).
# Kept on disk next to their experiment's manifest/runs.csv/findings for local
# lookup, but never committed: too large/numerous for git, and not needed to
# reproduce or verify canonical evidence (identity_columns has no filesystem
# path). See sources.json -> source_batch_id / run_id to locate a given run.
*/ema200/*/runs/
*/ema200/_scratch/
_unclassified/
